  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "the-world-around-us-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Ah, Falcon's newest student. He sends them all to me eventually.",
      "next": "the-world-around-us-o1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-world-around-us-o1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Shall I tell you how this world really works?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Please.",
          "next": "the-world-around-us-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "the-world-around-us"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-world-around-us-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Then sit, and listen.",
      "next": "world-lesson",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "world-lesson",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Falcon sent you? Then you've learned to hit things. Excellent. Now learn everything else.",
      "next": "world-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "world-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "An adventurer grows by walking the world: helping its people, finding its secrets, reading its signs. That is your Adventuring, and nothing else counts toward it.",
      "next": "world-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "world-3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Start with people. Go and speak with Mother Hesk at The Perch. Nobody on this island knows more gossip.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "world-w",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Mother Hesk, at The Perch. Go on.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "world-done",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "She told you about the Cathedrals? She tells everyone. But she's right about one thing: there's one in every town, and every one of them belongs to the Benefactor.",
      "next": "world-d2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "world-d2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Keep listening like that and you'll do well out there. Now, Falcon was asking after you. He's back at the stone circle, and he had that look he gets.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarians-letter-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "One more thing, if you're heading out with Falcon. I've lost a letter. It must have blown out of the window.",
      "next": "librarians-letter-o1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarians-letter-o1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "If you find it on your travels, I'd be grateful. And I'd rather nobody else read it.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'll keep an eye out.",
          "next": "librarians-letter-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "librarians-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarians-letter-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Thank you. The seal will tell me if anyone's opened it.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "letter-thanks",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "My letter! Seal intact, too. You're more trustworthy than most who come through here.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hello",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Everything that happens on the Landing ends up in a book eventually. Even you.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 0
      }
    }
  ],
  "chatter": [
    "Hm? Oh. Don't touch the shelves, please.",
    "Every book in here was carried up from the Layland by hand.",
    "Wind's from the south again. Close the shutters."
  ]
